#X msg 130 772 @ttl;
#X text 270 772 Time-to-live counter. When a new value is set \, the
cell counter for that cell is set to this value. Every time the cell
is output \, its individual counter (not this property!) is decremented
\, until it reaches zero. After that \, if @free is on \, the cell
is cleared. If this property equals zero \, the cell never cleared.
Type: int. Default value: 0\. Range: [0\..1024].;
